{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to manifest.json and replace the sources list with your URLs.",
    "",
    "chunk_tokens/overlap_tokens are counted with the embedding model's own",
    "tokenizer (BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5). 512 is the model's hard ceiling.",
    "",
    "Per-source keys override the defaults block. Only 'url', 'topic' and",
    "'category' are required; everything else falls back to defaults.",
    "",
    "'category' is the fallback for sections whose heading does not map to a",
    "category. Set infer_category_from_heading to false to force every chunk",
    "from a page into the declared category.",
    "",
    "Valid topics:     Hair Health, Weight Loss, Muscle Building, Nutrition,",
    "                  Skin Health, Cardiovascular Health, Digestive Health,",
    "                  Sleep, Hormones, General Wellness",
    "Valid categories: Causes, Symptoms, Diagnosis, Prevention, Treatment,",
    "                  Nutrition, Exercise, Supplements, Lifestyle, Research",
    "Valid source_types: government_health_portal, clinical_guideline,",
    "                  systematic_review, meta_analysis, clinical_trial,",
    "                  review_article, position_stand, reference_standard"
  ],

  "chunk_tokens": 512,
  "overlap_tokens": 50,

  "defaults": {
    "source_type": "government_health_portal",
    "publisher": "MedlinePlus (U.S. National Library of Medicine)",
    "infer_category_from_heading": true
  },

  "sources": [
